✅ 1. java.lang Package (Auto‑imported)

⭐ Object
Base class of all classes in Java.
Common methods:
toString() – returns object representation as String
equals() – compares two objects
hashCode() – returns hash value
clone() – creates a copy of the object
getClass() – returns runtime class

⭐ String
Immutable text class.
Common methods:
length()
charAt(int index)
substring(int start, int end)
toLowerCase(), toUpperCase()
contains(), startsWith(), endsWith()
replace(), trim()
split(String regex)
equals(), equalsIgnoreCase()

⭐ StringBuilder / StringBuffer
Mutable strings.
Common methods:
append()
insert()
replace()
delete()
reverse()
toString()

⭐ Math
Math utilities.
Common methods:
sqrt()
pow()
abs()
round(), ceil(), floor()
max(), min()
random()
